**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.lock
**/*.log
**/logs/
**/data/
**/*.mmdb

# Docker builds WebUI from source in its own stage.
/webui/dist/
/artifacts/
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
# Development-only files.
*.md
**/node_modules
